    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Forbes Property are delighted to present 5 Doonbeg House, Clare Village, Malahide Road, Dublin 13 a beautifully maintained two-bedroom ground floor apartment ideally positioned within this highly sought-after and well-established development.\n\nBoasting the rare advantage of its own private front door entrance, this bright and spacious home offers a wonderful sense of privacy and independence, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike.\n\nThe accommodation is well laid out and presented in excellent condition throughout, with generous living space, two well-proportioned bedrooms, and a practical floor plan designed for modern living. Adding further appeal is a sunny private patio area, perfect for al fresco dining, entertaining guests, or simply relaxing and enjoying the afternoon and evening sunshine.\n\nThe ground floor setting provides easy access and convenience, while the mature surroundings of Clare Village create a peaceful residential atmosphere.\n\nThe location is second to none, with an abundance of amenities on the doorstep including schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, sports clubs, parks and excellent public transport links. Both Malahide Village and Dublin City Centre are easily accessible, while Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorways are just a short drive away.\n\nCombining comfort, convenience and an exceptional location, 5 Doonbeg House represents a superb opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of North Dublin's most desirable residential developments."
